  - elementId: s1a-name
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 488, 224, 24]
    content:
      style: "$stageName"
      wrap: false
      text: 给定事实 facts
  - elementId: s1a-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 526, 260, 104]
    content:
      style: "$stageDesc"
      text: 本周刺激度 82% · 周三轻松跑 5km · 第 1 周。先把 facts 里所有数字（含嵌套列表）摊平成一个集合。
  - elementId: s1-arrow1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [324, 497, 37, 4]
    viewBox: [37, 4]
    points: "0,2 37,2"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "#9AA0A6"}
  # 阶段 2
  - elementId: s1b-chip
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [361, 486, 26, 26]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orange"}
  - elementId: s1b-chip-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [361, 486, 26, 26]
    content: {fontSize: 14, bold: true, color: "#FFFFFF", align: [center, middle], wrap: false, text: "2"}
  - elementId: s1b-name
    elementType: text
    bounds: [397, 488, 224, 24]
    content:
      style: "$stageName"
      wrap: false
      text: LLM 生成文案
  - elementId: s1b-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [361, 526, 260, 104]
    content:
      style: "$stageDesc"
      text: 模型把结构化结果翻译成人话。允许组织语言、调整语气，不允许引入任何新数字。
  - elementId: s1-arrow2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [621, 497, 37, 4]
    viewBox: [37, 4]
    points: "0,2 37,2"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "#9AA0A6"}
  # 阶段 3
  - elementId: s1c-chip
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [658, 486, 26, 26]
