  - elementId: s2-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [160, 900, 900, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$muted"
      wrap: false
      text: LLM 可以提议调整课表，但提议能不能执行由代码裁决——这不是给模型的「守则」，是越不过去的闸门。
  - elementId: s2-file
    elementType: text
    bounds: [960, 874, 256, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$muted"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      fontFamily: {latin: "Consolas", ea: "MiSans"}
      text: server/tune.py

  # ---- 关卡二 流水线 ----
  - elementId: s2-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 940, 1152, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$ink"}
  # 阶段 A
  - elementId: s2a-chip
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 956, 26, 26]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orange"}
  - elementId: s2a-chip-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 956, 26, 26]
    content: {fontSize: 14, bold: true, color: "#FFFFFF", align: [center, middle], wrap: false, text: "1"}
  - elementId: s2a-name
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 958, 240, 24]
    content:
      style: "$stageName"
      wrap: false
      text: LLM 提议微调
  - elementId: s2a-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 996, 300, 150]
    content:
      style: "$stageDesc"
      text: 每周首次打开今日卡时触发（幂等，每周最多调一次）。只许两种操作：move 把非关键课移到本周另一天；adjust 微调非关键课跑量。
  - elementId: s2-arrow1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [364, 967, 60, 4]
    viewBox: [60, 4]
    points: "0,2 60,2"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "#9AA0A6"}
  # 阶段 B
  - elementId: s2b-chip
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [424, 956, 26, 26]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orange"}
  - elementId: s2b-chip-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [424, 956, 26, 26]
    content: {fontSize: 14, bold: true, color: "#FFFFFF", align: [center, middle], wrap: false, text: "2"}
  - elementId: s2b-name
    elementType: text
    bounds: [460, 958, 380, 24]
    content:
      style: "$stageName"
      wrap: false
      text: 四道闸门 · 逐条硬校验
  - elementId: s2b-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [424, 996, 440, 150]
    content:
      style: "$stageDesc"
      lineHeight: 1.7
      text: |
        <p>① 目标是已计划、非关键的课？（关键课直接拒）</p>
        <p>② 单课跑量在原始值 ±10% 内、0.5km 取整？</p>
        <p>③ 调整后本周总跑量变化 ≤ 3%？</p>
        <p>④ 本周 ≤ 3 个操作、每节课 ≤ 1 个？</p>
  - elementId: s2-arrow2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [864, 967, 60, 4]
    viewBox: [60, 4]
    points: "0,2 60,2"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "#9AA0A6"}
  # 阶段 C
  - elementId: s2c-chip
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [924, 956, 26, 26]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orange"}
  - elementId: s2c-chip-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [924, 956, 26, 26]
    content: {fontSize: 14, bold: true, color: "#FFFFFF", align: [center, middle], wrap: false, text: "3"}
