  - elementId: vs-left-cap
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 1376, 530, 60]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: prompt 约束 = 请求。模型可以遵守，也可以不遵守——你无法审计它什么时候失灵，更没法写测试证明它一直有效。
  - elementId: vs-divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [622, 1332, 2, 104]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: vs-right-code
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 1332, 556, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$ink"
      wrap: false
