  - elementId: vs-right-cap
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 1376, 556, 60]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: 代码校验 = 法律。过不了校验的提案没有执行入口；行为可被测试（74 条用例覆盖边界）、被审计（全量埋点）、被复现。

  # ================= 落地结果 =================
  - elementId: ft-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 1472, 1152, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: ft-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 1492, 200, 20]
