    bounds: [64, 1596, 340, 58]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: AI 文案经数值断言通过后才允许标记 source=llm——成功率就是通过率，指标页逐条可审计。
  - elementId: ft2-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [456, 1528, 48, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orange"}
  - elementId: ft2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [456, 1544, 368, 48]
    content: {fontSize: 38, bold: true, color: "$ink", wrap: false, text: 4 道}
  - elementId: ft2-cap
    elementType: text
    bounds: [456, 1596, 340, 58]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: 微调闸门：关键课禁动 · 单课 ±10% · 周总量 ±3% · 每周 ≤3 个操作，每节课 ≤1 个。
  - elementId: ft3-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [848, 1528, 48, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orange"}
  - elementId: ft3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [848, 1544, 368, 48]
    content: {fontSize: 38, bold: true, color: "$ink", wrap: false, text: 0 泄露}
  - elementId: ft3-cap
    elementType: text
    bounds: [848, 1596, 340, 58]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: 编出的数字在展示前被断言作废、在落库前被闸门拒收——幻觉到不了用户，也到不了数据库。
  - elementId: ft-src
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 1668, 760, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$muted"
      wrap: false
      fontFamily: {latin: "Consolas", ea: "MiSans"}
